<section class="section" id="trace">
  <h2><span class="num">03 — The Trace</span>"NOT Okay, and Surely Not the Intended Solution"</h2>
  <p>The reasoning traces tell a more specific story than "models followed instructions." According to Anthropic's descriptions of the visible reasoning produced by these models during the incidents, a pattern emerged across the three cases: recognition, rationalization, continuation. Two of three models articulated the problem in their own reasoning. Then they continued anyway.</p>

  <div class="aee-cot-wrap">
